## Replanning

Design how replanning works.

Brain cannot modify plans.

Instead Brain returns:

ReplanRequest

Controller forwards it to Planner.

Planner returns a new ExecutionPlan.

Controller resumes execution.

---

## Redis Checkpoint Compatibility

Design the state so Controller can checkpoint after every transition.

The checkpoint should contain everything required to resume execution without rerunning completed work.

